body:
What about we use the namespace pattern that we use for other options? This could look like:

```js
const widget = makeWidget({
  escapeHits: true,
});
```

or with the list:

```js
const widget = makeWidget({
  escapeHits: {include: ['title', 'tags']},
});
```

